<p> <space dim="horizontal"/>  Schuhmacher <hi rendition="#g">Keck.</hi></p></div><lb/>
<div n="2" type="jAn"><p>c 3 ) Tübingen. <hi rendition="#fr">Mineralwasser=Empfeh-<lb/>
